{"applicability_conditions":"适用于具有异质晶粒结构（软CG区与硬FG区）的材料在弹塑性协同变形过程中的应变硬化，软硬区协同变形促进协调变形并诱导额外应变硬化；该式引自文献[29]。","identity":{"block_id":"b0058","equation_id":"equation_007","equation_number":"7","is_image":false,"latex_hint":"$$\n\\frac {d \\tau}{d \\varepsilon} = \\left(\\frac {d \\tau}{d \\varepsilon}\\right) _ {\\text { dis }} + \\left(\\frac {d \\tau}{d \\varepsilon}\\right) _ {\\text { HDI }}\\tag{7}\n$$","paper_id":"10.1016_j.vacuum.2026.115094"},"latex":"\\frac{d\\tau}{d\\varepsilon} = \\left(\\frac{d\\tau}{d\\varepsilon}\\right)_{\\text{dis}} + \\left(\\frac{d\\tau}{d\\varepsilon}\\right)_{\\text{HDI}}","purpose":"将总应变硬化率分解为位错（dislocation）硬化贡献与异质变形诱导（HDI）硬化贡献之和，用以描述软硬异构组织中协同变形引起的额外应变硬化。","symbols":[{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"总应变硬化率（剪切应力对应变的导数）","symbol":"\\frac{d\\tau}{d\\varepsilon}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"剪切应力（shear stress）","symbol":"\\tau","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"应变（strain）","symbol":"\\varepsilon","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"位错（dislocation）硬化对总应变硬化率的贡献","symbol":"\\left(\\frac{d\\tau}{d\\varepsilon}\\right)_{\\text{dis}}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"异质变形诱导（HDI，hetero-deformation induced）硬化对总应变硬化率的贡献","symbol":"\\left(\\frac{d\\tau}{d\\varepsilon}\\right)_{\\text{HDI}}","unit":null,"value":null}],"unmapped":["文中指出：随着全局应变增加，软CG区与硬FG区发生协同变形，进一步促进协调变形并诱导额外应变硬化。","结合式(6)与式(7)，异质晶粒结构的Zr0.50钢中GND密度增加，从而有助于额外的硬化能力（即HDI硬化效应），并表现为HDI延展性。"]}